@anon.b4276b7b39cc559116fc5d29527aa342.2003 = private unnamed_addr constant [316 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for the presence of the `pass` statement in non-empty class bodies\0Ain `.pyi` files.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AThe `pass` statement is always unnecessary in non-empty class bodies in\0Astubs.\0A\0A## Example\0A```pyi\0Aclass MyClass:\0A    x: int\0A    pass\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```pyi\0Aclass MyClass:\0A    x: int\0A```\0A", align 1
